WEBVTT

NOTE
Illustrated menu-path guide. Not an actual screen recording.

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.833
This guide exports contacts from Outlook dot com or Outlook on the web.

2
00:00:04.833 --> 00:00:08.292
Sign in to Outlook on the web and choose People.

3
00:00:08.292 --> 00:00:12.750
Open Manage contacts, then choose Export contacts.

4
00:00:12.750 --> 00:00:18.000
Select All contacts, or choose the specific contacts folder you want.

5
00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:22.708
Choose Export and save the CSV file in a location you can find.

6
00:00:22.708 --> 00:00:30.042
In Gold Mine Genie, choose the CSV in Import Studio, check the field matches, then review the people.
